B.Bc=new A.jX("Rabies is almost always fatal once clinical disease develops. Indicated post-exposure prophylaxis must not be delayed.",B.iK,B.db)
B.B9=new A.jX("Do not delay wound washing while vaccination is being arranged.",B.iK,B.cm)
B.Bf=new A.jX("RIG/RMAb is for local infiltration into and around the wound \u2014 not for routine intramuscular injection at a distant site.",B.iK,B.db)
B.Bd=new A.jX("Do not give RIG beyond the 7th day after the 1st vaccine dose on day 0.",B.iK,B.cm)
B.Bg=new A.jX("Do not inject rabies vaccine into the gluteal region.",B.iK,B.cm)
