B.B8=new A.jX("Treat a patient as previously immunised only on documented evidence of a complete previous PrEP or PEP course with modern vaccines.",B.hW,B.cm)
B.Ba=new A.jX("If a vaccine dose is delayed, resume or continue the regimen \u2014 do not restart it.",B.hW,B.db)
